[{"title":"七夕边马二宪使许过繁台别业不成辄用七字句述我志怀","author":"李梦阳","text":"懒游因病困蒙茸，不独炎天万事慵。\n七夕邀行齐踊跃，两人羁绊阻迎逢。\n大河平地涛长涌，乔岳清秋雾不封。\n次第荣途俱獬豸，迂疏故国且芙蓉。\n壮夫激烈悲迟暮，执友团圞喜去冬。\n久避鸢肩优谏诤，亟推经笥贯中庸。\n繁台禹庙梁王榭，古寺残碑宋代松。\n吾企杜高名不及，汝追枚马涕何从。\n虚疑豪侠轻朱亥，实被文章误蔡邕。\n愤起铁椎心枉费，曲终焦尾意还浓。\n不争期约惭牛女，恐使流传笑駏蛩。\n末俗但知张市虎，异时谁切辨衣蜂。\n云吁世路聊三径，敢说天门尚九重。\n宠岂尽轩卫国鹤，尽宜偏骇叶公龙。\n蒐园卜筑邻猿岛，茅屋昏晨节梵钟。\n修竹雁池虽惨惨，水花云叶固溶溶。\n悔将朱绂抛渔艇，誓住丹丘学老农。\n为底回骢孤蟋蟀，徒思临沼共鰅鳙。\n踟蹰莫畏风沙眯，吊唁应愁辇路冲。\n许过只须图酩酊，有谈母遽及徽宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五日蔡河废津汎集","author":"李梦阳","text":"当年锦缆帝王州，此日荒津竞渡游。\n宾客未销梁苑气，江山聊写汨罗愁。\n流金赤日偏输浪，似盖轻云故翼舟。\n鱼听歌钟沈复跃，燕窥舞袖去还留。\n调冰雪藕佳人并，断艾分蒲上客酬。\n出溜只疑天上转，溯洄真在镜中浮。\n阴阴瞑色凫鹥岸，袅袅风香杜若洲。\n醉里惊闻催住桨，别船追进夕筵羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"戈马喧喧动万雷，黄旗绕绕拂仙台。\n天上再开新日月，南郊不改旧蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"汉家天子自天威，春祀南郊春雪围。\n片片琼花飘玉路，五云偏逐衮龙飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"坛官秉笏候金钟，月出西南照雪峰。\n不向蓬莱看五色，那知天子是真龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"中坛日月照天门，上帝龙行羽卫屯。\n烟里桂花旋玉兔，火开三尺抱金盆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"外坛罗列黄金榜，海岳齐开白石门。\n直使衡山驰蓟域，更看四海过昆崙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其六","author":"李梦阳","text":"神来击鼓复吹簧，一道虹飞万丈光。\n阊阖清风摇玉烛，至尊独立殿中央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其七","author":"李梦阳","text":"帝是高皇八叶孙，隆准龙颜称至尊。\n翠羽缤纷来众圣，洋洋古乐乱云门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其八","author":"李梦阳","text":"汉主登封巨迹空，赭山秦帝洞庭中。\n何如黍稷大神享，万岁高高大极宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其九","author":"李梦阳","text":"天马元从天上落，七星装入宝刀头。\n坛空月照更衣殿，万锦群中刷紫骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德元年郊祀歌十首 其十","author":"李梦阳","text":"金舆还内放人看，万户千门震地欢。\n绣扇徐开龙虎气，君身不动泰山安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"古时灞水即芦沟，今代车书似水流。\n日间五色龙文气，天上春开五凤楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"渔阳北塞古风沙，二月春风万柳斜。\n蓟门转作长安苑，燕桃开出五陵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"慷慨燕云十六州，天门北极帝星头。\n胡尘一洗桑乾净，荬载朝宗四海流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"山作青龙左右盘，扶桑西影拂桑乾。\n日月光华朝万国，天留北海作长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"天皇按剑拂金鞍，饮马追胡翰海乾。\n归来并立擎天柱，不数刘家承露盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其六","author":"李梦阳","text":"胡后妆楼换上阳，春风珠箔舞垂杨。\n半夜开城归万马，至今迷失几鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其七","author":"李梦阳","text":"今朝望海海云生，五色云中白玉城。\n金陵巧接盘龙势，南北何如汉二京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其八","author":"李梦阳","text":"塞上星飞化羽林，鼓音咸作管箫音。\n将军把剑闻鸡舞，玉女朱楼学凤吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其九","author":"李梦阳","text":"高鼻胡奴入汉关，皂旗千队射雕还。\n君看万古昏星月，洗出中华叠翠山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"帝京篇十首 其十","author":"李梦阳","text":"自从黄帝破蚩尤，涿鹿云黄黑帝愁。\n盘石果然为碣石，幽州常作帝王州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皇陵歌","author":"李梦阳","text":"皇陵叠翠倚丹霄，绛节飞光夜夜朝。\n千古长风吹海月，万山松柏照空寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"传闻驾回有纪二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"正月传闻大驾还，七日巳度居庸关。\n铙歌拟续之回曲，塞外应添驻跸山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"传闻驾回有纪二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"白城新起望夷台，黄钺森森耀日开。\n六骡远遁胡沙静，六龙腾踏驾空回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣节闻驾出塞二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"千官北首望龙旂，万国车书集凤闱。\n八骏穆王秋色远，几时亲拥白狼归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣节闻驾出塞二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"万乘时巡万寿临，銮舆漠漠碛沙深。\n非忘殿阙呼嵩日，应系单于款塞心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正德七年正月黄河清自清河至于柳家浦九十里清五日焉","author":"李梦阳","text":"黄河水自昆崙出，万古东流元不清。\n今瑞定于今帝应，世人休拟圣人生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉靖元年歌二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"元年正月又王春，四海人称小圣人。\n巳报岐山鸣彩凤，更传关内出麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉靖元年歌二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"大明十帝转神明，天意分明赐太平。\n紫盖复从嘉靖始，黄河先为圣人清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送乐清少府二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"羽骑骖驔簇晚洲，彭彭箫鼓引官舟。\n为言独对青松树，何似逢迎绿水头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送乐清少府二首 其二 赠黄州牧","author":"李梦阳","text":"黄州江比使君清，赤壁山留万古名。\n黄州小儿骑竹马，来时相送去时迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人","author":"李梦阳","text":"王孙笑向碧山栖，春日春萝袅袅低。\n予亦悠悠芳桂者，白云愁色草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周判官","author":"李梦阳","text":"明镫绿酒五花裘，客舍新秋萤火流。\n问君不饮真何事，明日出城风叶愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人入蜀","author":"李梦阳","text":"锦江风高生夕波，芦荻萧萧秋雁多。\n问尔乡关何处是，巴人时唱下渝歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏东方朔赠马吏部","author":"李梦阳","text":"据地酣歌金马门，如花少女笑无言。\n不是偷桃太无那，人间那谪岁星魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","