男乐耕耘女绩麻。\n客到大开萱草阁，春风时动紫荆花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56100,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蔡帅","author":"李梦阳","text":"时清昼卧铜牙弩，客散宵披玉检文。\n可道将军浑是武，曾将三策献明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56101,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王韬","author":"李梦阳","text":"王郎口谈金虎文，自称师是紫阳君。\n挂帆明日忽南去，影落龙江五色云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56102,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠罗氏","author":"李梦阳","text":"罗隐北下黄金台，牡丹芍药次第开。\n极目长江渺天际，八闽秋尽一帆回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56103,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊进士入朝三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"武帝南征并海回，九天云䍐拂天来。\n缥缈群仙朝绛节，五云宫阙是蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56104,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊进士入朝三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"苍苍玄武镇皇州，天上银河转地流。\n言君不是乘槎者，昨夜分明到斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56105,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送熊进士入朝三首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"金马岧峣接凤台，石渠高阁倚天开。\n仲舒早备天人策，汉主临轩问自裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56106,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月望丘翁林亭二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"今日花朝好风日，梁园酒新花更开。\n走觅南邻立处士，月明骑马醉深回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56107,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月望丘翁林亭二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"南邻处士闭柴门，竹树春风野径昏。\n痛饮狂歌人不识，客来惟有酒盈尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56108,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬郑生二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"东园红杏日纷纷，东望无烟蝶满云。\n少出违期因怯马，独吟停盏为思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56109,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬郑生二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"城门春禁不行车，病惧攀鞍只在家。\n昨日东风来著意，庭前忽放数枝花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56110,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨俟屠君不至","author":"李梦阳","text":"暮倚高楼因候客，雨来如注复如丝。\n试看春日洪州道，可是山阴夜雪时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56111,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄顾台州二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"巾山何似岘山游，云岛长和海色幽。\n定有儿童笑山简，君今孰与郑台州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56112,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄顾台州二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"怪尔分符坐赤城，东南遥见海霞生。\n梅开莫寄西来使，春到烦求碧玉精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56113,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太白山人仙游吴越稔矣日者卜居吴兴而婚施氏妻妹予闻之辄诗嘲焉二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"范子无端出五湖，西施并载有耶无。\n诗人只合莺莺伴，施家今是大姨夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56114,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]